sdiv2: x / 2, for x from -999 to 999, truncated toward zero. Inline: no call.
Listed at cells 10-15, with x in cell 90.
Copy cells 10-15 to where the program needs x / 2, with each 90 changed to the program's cell for x; the program goes on with x / 2 in the accumulator.
It overwrites the accumulator; x is kept.
Size 6 cells. It runs 6 instructions, straight through.
Exact over the domain.

cell  contents   notes
 10     190      CLA 90   cells 10-15: 5x, shifted right one place: 5x / 10
 11     290      ADD 90
 12     290      ADD 90
 13     290      ADD 90
 14     290      ADD 90
 15     401      SFT 01
 90     000      data: x, the program's cell, which is kept
